# The married-name ROLE must not sit on a man. Emma, 2026-08-24:
# "ontologically married name on a man means more like adopted surname. So men's
# 'married names' should not have the role of married name."
#
# QuickStatements cannot remove a qualifier from a statement it did not create, so
# this REMOVES the P734 statement and re-adds it without the role.
#
# Q141168827  Hans Eivind Garborg (male) -- P734 Garborg carried
# P3831 -> Q28418670 married name.
#
# NOT replaced with Q118383793 adoptive name: in this material a man's second surname
# is usually a FARM name taken by residence, not adoption. Q141169072 is the case --
# Adne Olsen Grotheim became Adne Olsen Garborg by moving to the Garborg farm.

-Q141168827	P734	Q30250555	P3831	Q28418670
Q141168827	P734	Q30250555
